  index and the (1-τR) click guard. The live version keeps pad voices on phase
  accumulators so chord changes glide without clicks.
- Instrument: in: pitch/gate streams (from S1/S4) or knob channels. Out: audio.
  Coupling: low.
- Live: knob (proven: perform.py plays it).

